    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Luisa Serrano",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100333023324433275426/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVsXF6z1qp6_L7Y1V50u6w322gJl0345sldLjknWapfBlYfuyzQ1g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Hello everyone! If you love this shoe store, they are now open in Centre Rockland and ready to welcome their favorite customers.",
        "time": 1756696849,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Joanna Demi",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117037273559803713652/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVjAoTaJ3nN1ka6evdifsGGSciDt0REFqQgr-hiP-CSzw978uk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "What great customer service! Alan was so nice- I went in just to look at boots with my daughter. I have wide feet it is usually hard to find proper shoes that fit… both my daughter and I left with winter boots- we will definitely be repeat customers- great service, good products- so happy you are now in Rockland shopping centre!",
        "time": 1760964438,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Natacha G. Filion",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102990330563976867846/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVGdpcYcgDNuK0ugzbCny_hwNhxzG6VHiAhN5c4NJNZeQbUUYdA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Went to lunch with my mom yesterday and she asked if I needed any winter boots or if I was in need of footwear.  I actually had noticed my old Skechers starting to rip from the inside.\n\nSo she suggested we go see her \"nice shoe store guy\" at that dying Pincourt Mall, that mall Faubourg de l'Île has been slowly dying  and starting to look eerie with all the storefronts closed except for a few survivors.\n\nNotably this one, Exess Shoes made famous by its owner's reputation as an outstanding shop owner.\n\nI was showing my new shoes to my coworker and she knew exactly who I was talking about.  He often gets shoutouts in the Pincourt Peeps Facebook group",
        "time": 1665942195,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Chris Clarke",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111198029123769106766/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIw44-KMhd5VsoAM6i1e1VG_cRN-S4qH-Rb0HJNTt_X_paAqA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "This is a great shoe store! I bought a pair of sandals last summer and loved them so much I recently went back for another pair in a different color. I walked out with 2 additional pairs of shoes. Alan remembers his customers and knows what we like. My husband walked out with 3 pairs of shoes thanks to Alan’s patience and the large selection of different sizes and widths of shoes. Alan and Lorena are a wonderful husband and wife team.",
        "time": 1681840514,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dino Pacifici",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118268200626177055468/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVywzzPTUDi9-ytcTvAFGKCjwDPftdBCMdMOWJa1vLvecraCNP-=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Alan and Lorena are wonderful owners of this great shoe store. They are professional, detailed and very nice people. They give you the time and consideration you need to get exactly what you want. Highly recommended.",
        "time": 1672519864,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
